c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "procrastination and emotion", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.30804701790513794, "w": 0.2909616410062086, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Questions 17-22", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.40149273357727505, "w": 0.17504023848124456, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Complete the summary below.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.43175136351517507, "w": 0.3032575356097359, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Choose ONE WORD ONLY from the passage for each answer.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.46200999345307514, "w": 0.6115455349716206, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "What makes us procrastinate?", "x": 0.3473929903484034, "y": 0.5330015409943268, "w": 0.3464238219600864, "h": 0.020391204035162976, "c": 1, "size": 14.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Many people think that procrastination is the result of 17 ............", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5636384033349332, "w": 0.7623215771044554, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Others believe it to be the result of an inability to organise time efficiently.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5919687534090708, "w": 0.7590964496326172, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "But scientific studies suggest that procrastination is actually due to poor mood", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6202991789259935, "w": 0.8069195219097364, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "management. The tasks we are most likely to put off are those that could", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6486294535573461, "w": 0.8069199320095516, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "damage our self-esteem or cause us to feel 18 ............ when we think about", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6768486764091467, "w": 0.8075602003460627, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "them. Research comparing chronic procrastinators with other people even", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7051789510404993, "w": 0.8071669146232674, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "found differences in the brain regions associated with regulating emotions and", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.733509376557422, "w": 0.8068542135141628, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "identifying 19 ............", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7618397266315596, "w": 0.29176792287416814, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Emotionally loaded and difficult tasks often cause us to procrastinate. Getting", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7901700767056973, "w": 0.8070502412258376, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "ready to take 20 ............ might be a typical example of one such task.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8185005022226199, "w": 0.7586933215142566, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "People who are likely to procrastinate tend to be either 21 ............ or", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8468308522967575, "w": 0.7625023285980133, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "those with low self-esteem.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8751859476043823, "w": 0.2849144629184159, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}